         "step": 1,
         "text": "\\( \\frac{dx}{dt} = \\frac{2 t}{t^{2} + 1} + 4 \\) and, by the chain rule, \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} = - 9 t e^{- \\frac{3 t^{2}}{4}} \\).",
